Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790006399999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789948799999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The breakout is only three bars; the preceding 27 bars overlap heavily and the region 2357-2557 can still be read as the operating trading range rather than broken.", "Two earlier upside probes failed to hold: bar 110 high 2680 closed 2514.72, bar 113 high 2609.02 closed 2514.07, so upside spikes in this region have recently been rejected.", "2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the whole post-spike section can be read as one broad trading range whose upper extreme has not been exceeded.", "Bar 119 makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700) with a lower tail to 2568.16, a pause rather than a strong continuation bar, and bar 114 had just traded down to 2358.62 four bars before the breakout."], "evidence_for": ["Successive higher lows and higher highs since the range low: 2357.18 -> 2358.62 -> 2413.82 -> 2436.87 and 2557.46 -> 2680 -> 2700.", "Three consecutive closes above the range ceiling 2557.46 (2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90) after bars 110 and 113 exceeded it intraday but closed back inside at 2514.72 and 2514.07 \u2014 the first sustained push beyond the ceiling.", "Bar 117 is a large bull trend bar (2446.22 to 2612.02, range 206.65) closing in its top quarter, and bar 118 adds follow-through to 2700; bar 119 holds above the ceiling with a close of 2642.90.", "Window-scale structure is upward: 14 bear bars to 1368.42, then a bull reversal and roughly 105 bars of rising swing lows off 1368.42."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window opens at 2116.86 and falls to 1368.42 (bar 13 low, close 1568.55), then reverses; final close 2642.90 is about +24.9% versus the first open and about +93% above the window low.", "Bars 87-89 are the spike: 1916.51 to 2252.16, 2252.20 to 2326.32, 2326.31 to 2515.30, with the window high 2771 printed on bar 89.", "Bars 90-116 are two-sided: overlapping bodies, highs at 2557.46 (bar 95) and 2609.02 (bar 113), lows clustered 2357.18-2425.44; bar 110 spiked to 2680 and closed 2514.72 back inside the range.", "Bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 \u2014 the first consecutive closes above the 2557.46 ceiling; bar 117 has open 2446.22, high 2643.52, low 2436.87, range 206.65, closing in its top quarter; bar 118 reaches 2700.", "Bar 119 (open 2632.98, high 2645.88, low 2568.16, close 2642.90) is a 77.72-range bar closing near its high while holding above the range ceiling; it makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700).", "Recent lows rise: 2357.18 (bar 101), 2358.62 (bar 114), 2370.54 (bar 115), 2413.82 (bar 116), 2436.87 (bar 117), 2568.16 (bar 119).", "Price 2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the post-spike section is not yet a confirmed new-high trend."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg: a run of lower highs and lower lows from 2116.86 (first open) to 1368.42 (bar 13 low), with widening ranges into bars 9-13 (2006.06->1859.02, 1859.01->1813.04, 1813.04->1731.00, 1731.00->1581.32, 1581.32->1568.55).", "end_time_ms": 1780704000000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779580800000, "upper_boundary": "2139.34"}, {"description": "Selling climax / possible mtr-like low area: bar 13 prints the window low 1368.42 with its close 1568.55 well above that low, and bar 14 reverses to close 1687.83 near its high (high 1690.78) after opening 1568.55.", "end_time_ms": 1780790400000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780617600000, "upper_boundary": "1690.78"}, {"description": "Bull sequence from the window low: rising swing lows 1512.91/1533.12, 1821.49, 2357.18, 2358.62 punctuated by consolidations (about 1512-1725, 1850-1975, 2357-2557); successive bull legs reached 1954.36 (bar 59) and 2771 (bar 89).", "end_time_ms": 1789948799999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Two-sided trading range after the bar-87..89 spike: overlapping bars between the 2357.18 low (bar 101) and the 2557.46 high (bar 95), with two upside probes that closed back inside \u2014 2680 high closing 2514.72 (bar 110) and 2609.02 high closing 2514.07 (bar 113).", "end_time_ms": 1789689599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2557.46"}, {"description": "Upside breakout attempt from that range: bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90, the first closes above the 2557.46 ceiling, with bar 118 printing 2700, the highest high since the 2771 spike of bar 89.", "end_time_ms": 1789948799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789603200000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Continuation: additional closes above 2700 with rising closes would indicate acceptance above the range, shifting focus to the 2771 bar-89 spike high.", "Failure: closes back below 2568.16 (bar 119 low) and then 2557.46 would indicate a failed breakout and a return into the 2357.18-2557.46 range.", "A close below 2357.18 would remove the two-sided floor and support a broader range-breakdown or bear-leg read.", "Repeated closes between 2557.46 and 2700 without progress would mark a new, higher trading range rather than a continuation trend."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789991999999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The window's dominant character is two-sided: bars 19-85 (67 of 120 bars) overlap inside 2411.04-2544.63 with small bodies and mid-range closes, and bars 19-60 alone are a roughly 2411.04-2544.63 range with no sustained trend.", "Two prior upside spikes in this same window were rejected and fully retraced: bar 61 high 2680 closed at 2555.52 and price fell to 2358.62 by bar 86; bar 81 high 2609.02 closed at 2514.07. Precedent argues the fresh spike can fail the same way.", "Bar 120 leaves a 126.85-point upper tail; acceptance above 2700 is thin (close only 23.15 points, about 0.85%, above the level) and the high 2850 was rejected inside the bar.", "The 2700 'double top' is made of wick highs only (closes there were 2638.49 and 2664.73), so it is a round-number touch zone that sellers have already defended twice, not a confirmed ceiling that has been decisively cleared by closes.", "Only one bar exists above 2700 with no follow-through bar in the window, so acceptance of the breakout is unverified; the whole-window gain arrives through multiple two-sided swings rather than a single clean trend, and the trend label rests mainly on the final ~3 days."], "evidence_for": ["Higher highs and higher lows on every intermediate swing since bar 86: lows 2358.62 -> 2370.54 -> 2427.28 -> 2568.16 -> 2658.06, highs 2643.52 (bar 104) -> 2700 (bar 108) -> 2700 (bar 118) -> 2850 (bar 120).", "Bull trend bars closing near their highs: bar 103 close 2578.6 vs high 2585.5; bar 104 close 2636.28 vs high 2643.52; bar 120 close 2723.15, the highest close of the window and above the prior best close 2664.73 (bar 118).", "Bar 120 closes at 2723.15, above the twice-tested 2700 highs (bars 108 and 118), which is the window's highest resistance being exceeded on a closing basis.", "Directional persistence: the last 18 closes (bars 103-120) all hold above 2576.9 and no bar since bar 102 has traded below bar 103's low 2495.82, so the Always-In side has been long for about 18 bars (roughly 3 days).", "Pullbacks within the leg are shallow and are bought: bars 112-114 retrace only to 2568.16, well above the 2450-2496 base built in bars 87-101, and the next push makes a new high at 2850.", "Bar 120's range (191.94) expands sharply versus bars 105-119 (8.65-58.65), the signature of a spike/breakout bar rather than more overlap."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars from open_time 1788264000000 to 1789977600000 (close 1789991999999); net change from bar-1 open 2459.5 to bar-120 close 2723.15 is +263.65 (+10.7%).", "Twin lows 80 bars apart: bar 6 (1788336000000) low 2357.18 and bar 86 (1789488000000) low 2358.62; each was followed by a bull leg (bar 6 to bar 18 high 2537.57; bar 86 to bar 120 high 2850).", "Round 2700 was tagged twice by bar highs: bar 108 (1789804800000) high 2700 with close 2638.49, and bar 118 (1789948800000) high 2700 with close 2664.73; earlier rejected upsides were bar 61 high 2680 (close 2555.52) and bar 81 high 2609.02 (close 2514.07).", "Final bar (open 2658.81, high 2850, low 2658.06, close 2723.15) is a 191.94-point range bar, roughly 3-10x the 8.65-58.65 ranges of bars 105-119, with a 126.85-point upper tail; its close is 23.15 above 2700 but 126.85 below the high.", "Bars 19-85 (67 bars) overlap inside 2411.04-2544.63 with many small bodies and mid-range closes; the only excursion above that band in that stretch was bar 81's 2609.02 spike, which closed back at 2514.07.", "Higher-low sequence since the second low: 2358.62 (bar 86 low) -> 2370.54 (bar 92 low) -> 2427.28 (bar 96 low) -> 2568.16 (bar 114 low) -> 2658.06 (bar 120 low); higher highs: 2643.52 (bar 104 high) -> 2700 (bar 108 high) -> 2700 (bar 118 high) -> 2850 (bar 120 high).", "Bull trend bars with closes near highs: bar 103 (open 2507.15, close 2578.6, high 2585.5), bar 104 (open 2579.97, close 2636.28, high 2643.52), bar 120 (close 2723.15, above every prior close in the window; prior highest close was 2664.73 at bar 118). All 18 closes from bar 103 to bar 120 hold above 2576.9, and no bar since bar 102 has traded below bar 103's low 2495.82."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Broad two-sided trading range covering most of the window: lower boundary the twin lows 2357.18 (bar 6) and 2358.62 (bar 86); upper boundary the twice-touched 2700 (bar 108 and bar 118 highs), with earlier rejected spikes at 2680 (bar 61) and 2609.02 (bar 81). Bars 19-85 (67 bars) overlap inside the 2411.04-2544.63 core.", "end_time_ms": 1789977599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1788264000000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}, {"description": "Equal-low double bottom: bar 6 low 2357.18 and bar 86 low 2358.62, 80 bars apart, each followed by a multi-leg bull move; the second low started a clean higher-low sequence (2370.54 bar 92 low, 2427.28 bar 96 low, 2568.16 bar 114 low). Descriptive pattern, not a reversal prediction.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1788336000000, "upper_boundary": null}, {"description": "Bull leg/channel from the bar-86 low: bars 87-104 rise from 2358.62 to 2643.52 (bar 104 high) in two pushes, bars 105-111 pause in a seven-bar 2604.75-2700 range, bars 112-114 pull back only to 2568.16, then bars 115-120 extend to 2850. Pullbacks stay shallow (about 2.9% at bars 112-114) and every intermediate swing low is higher.", "end_time_ms": 1789977599999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Prior upside spike was rejected: bar 61 (open 2457.12, high 2680, close 2555.52) broke the mid-window range and was fully retraced to bar 86 low 2358.62; bar 81's 2609.02 spike closed back at 2514.07. Both upside spikes before the current one failed and gave back the breakout.", "end_time_ms": 1789502399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789128000000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Final bar (open_time 1789977600000) breaks above the twice-tested 2700 resistance: open 2658.81, high 2850, low 2658.06, close 2723.15, a 191.94-point range bar with a 126.85-point upper tail. Close is above the 2700 double top but well below the high; no follow-through bar exists inside the window.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2658.06", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Follow-through confirmation: a subsequent bar closing above 2723.15 with its low above 2700 would confirm acceptance of the breakout and reinforce bull-trend/breakout-spike.", "Failed breakout: a close back below 2700 inside the bar-120 range, especially a bear bar closing below bar 120's low 2658.06, would mark a failed breakout at the 2700 double top and shift the read toward trading-range or transition at the range high.", "Loss of 2568.16 (bar 114 low) breaks the higher-low sequence running from bar 86 and would shift the read from bull leg to deep pullback or a return into the broad range.", "A close below 2495.82 (bar 103 low) would negate the bars 103-104 breakout leg entirely and reassert the 2411-2544 range as the operative structure.", "Continued overlapping bars between 2646.02 and 2850 without a new high above 2850 would convert the breakout into a small range at the highs and lower always_in_relevance."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2391.1", "close_time_ms": 1789577999999, "high": "2395.87", "low": "2386.73", "open": "2392.87", "open_time_ms": 1789574400000, "volume": "1973346.781"}, {"close": "2384.88", "close_time_ms": 1789581599999, "high": "2392.25", "low": "2370.54", "open": "2391.1", "open_time_ms": 1789578000000, "volume": "2783910.164"}, {"close": "2394.67", "close_time_ms": 1789585199999, "high": "2419.22", "low": "2377.61", "open": "2384.88", "open_time_ms": 1789581600000, "volume": "315